{"schemaVersion":1,"skill":{"id":"github--awesome-copilot--data-breach-blast-radius","name":"data-breach-blast-radius","description":"Pre-breach impact analysis: inventories sensitive data (PII, PHI, PCI-DSS, credentials), traces data flows, scores exposure vectors, and produces a regulatory blast radius report with fine ranges sourced verbatim from GDPR Art. 83, CCPA § 1798.155(a), and HIPAA 45 CFR § 160.404. Cost benchmarks from IBM Cost of a Data Breach Report (annually updated). All citations in references/SOURCES.md for verification. Use when asked: \"assess breach impact\", \"what data could be exposed\", \"calculate blast radius\", \"data exposure analysis\", \"how bad would a breach be\", \"quantify data risk\", \"sensitive data inventory\", \"data flow security audit\", \"pre-breach assessment\", \"worst-case breach scenario\", \"breach readiness\", \"data risk report\", \"/data-breach-blast-radius\". For any stack handling user data, health records, or financial information. Output labels law-sourced figures (exact) vs heuristic estimates (planning only). Does not replace legal counsel.","category":"Security","tags":["data","breach","blast","radius","pre","impact","analysis","inventories","sensitive","pii","phi","pci","dss","credentials","traces","flows","scores","exposure"],"repo":"github/awesome-copilot","owner":"github","stars":39944,"official":true,"featured":false,"license":"MIT","licensePath":"LICENSE","revision":"70ddff7fab9d4d49743d221b56d761cff58048d0","path":"skills/data-breach-blast-radius","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/github/awesome-copilot/tree/70ddff7fab9d4d49743d221b56d761cff58048d0/skills/data-breach-blast-radius","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T11:14:06.196Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-12T07:38:37Z","fileCount":8,"bytes":86932,"sha256":"d61d7e6036a67fa25afa016b61d4130448f3e74896dfafef1847f1f01fc86bbe","historical":false},"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","sourcePath":"skills/data-breach-blast-radius/SKILL.md","bytes":14320,"sha256":"d61d7e6036a67fa25afa016